direction: down
start: Session start
meta: Load name + description (~100 tokens each)
req: User request
match: Match against descriptions
body: Load SKILL.md body (<5k tokens)
check: Run check script (output only)
out: Result + check output
start -> meta
meta -> match
req -> match
match -> body: match
match -> out: no match, no skill
body -> check
check -> body: FAIL, fix and re-run
check -> out: exit 0
